  "issue_title": "feat(submission): pack schema and theta integrity gates for offline preflight (gates 6-7)",
  "issue_body": "## Type\r\n\r\nGeneral improvement \u2014 submission validation infrastructure\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\n`trinity.submission` offline preflight (merged in #104) runs gates 1\u20135 before a PR, but several common rejection causes are still unchecked offline:\r\n\r\n1. **Receipt schema drift** \u2014 `receipt.json` can omit `benchmark`, claim the wrong benchmark, report a wrong `n_total`, or list pool models that do not match the maintained pool.\r\n2. **Theta packing mismatch** \u2014 `head_weights.npy` + `svf_scales.npy` may not round-trip through the canonical `coordinator.params.pack` / `unpack` layout that CMA-ES and `pack_submission.py` use, indicating a corrupted or hand-edited pack.\r\n\r\nBoth checks are CPU-only (no GPU, no OpenRouter).\r\n\r\n## Proposed scope\r\n\r\n* `src/trinity/submission/schema.py` \u2014 `PackSchemaValidator`, required receipt fields, benchmark/pool/`n_total` cross-checks\r\n* `src/trinity/submission/gates.py` \u2014 gates 6 (`pack_schema`) and 7 (`theta_integrity`) added to `OFFLINE_GATES`\r\n* `scripts/pr_eval.py` \u2014 run gates 6\u20137 before any GPU work (same as gates 1\u20135)\r\n* `scripts/preflight_submission.py` + `SUBMITTING.md` \u2014 document gates 1\u20137\r\n* `tests/test_submission_schema.py` \u2014 offline unit tests for schema + theta round-trip failures\r\n\r\n## Acceptance\r\n\r\n* Valid packs from `pack_submission.py` pass gates 6\u20137\r\n* Wrong benchmark, bad `n_total`, and non-round-tripping weights are rejected with stable reason codes\r\n* `pytest tests/test_submission_schema.py tests/test_submission_preflight.py -q` green\r\n* Full CI (`ruff`, `mypy`, tests) green\r\n",
  "merged_at": "2026-07-11T04:10:09.000Z",
